## 2. Matchup & AI Difficulty Matrix (840 Matches)

Each cell below aggregates **30 matches** (15 as P1, 15 as P2) across the four-tier `MIXED` AI cycle: **Tree-hopper** (Easy), **Cricket** (Balanced), **Beetle** (Defensive), and **Bullet Ant** (Master).

